* ============================================================================
* 10_table1_descriptives.do — 描述性统计 (strategic_diff)
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}
* ============================================================================

version 19
clear all
set more off
set maxvar 32767

if "$data_dir" == ""    global data_dir "../data"
if "$tables_dir" == ""  global tables_dir "../output/tables"

use "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", clear

* st-descriptives-01 fix (2026-06-03): 本表独立 use 全面板后直接 estpost summarize,
* 无先行回归留下 e(sample), 故描述统计覆盖全面板 (含零新闻 bank-year), 与主回归
* if e(sample) 样本 N 不一致 — 在表注如实披露 (顶刊复现包诚实度; 对齐 benefit_society/10).
* P0-3 口径一致: 描述统计报告回归实际使用的缩尾后 DV ({{MAIN_DV}}_w), 与主回归同口径
estpost summarize {{MAIN_DV}}_w {{MAIN_DIFF_VAR}} {{FLUIDITY_VAR}} {{SIM_MAX_VAR}} ///
    strat_diff_n3 strat_diff_n4 strat_diff_n6 strat_diff_n7 ///
    strat_diff_n5_lda strat_diff_n5_emb ///
    {{COHERENCE_VAR}} {{TONE_VAR}} $controls, detail

esttab using "$tables_dir/table1_descriptives.tex", replace ///
    cells("count mean(fmt(3)) sd(fmt(3)) min(fmt(3)) p25(fmt(3)) p50(fmt(3)) p75(fmt(3)) max(fmt(3))") ///
    label nomtitle nonumber booktabs ///
    title("Descriptive Statistics --- strategic_diff panel") ///
    note("Descriptives over the full panel (incl. zero-news bank-years); regression sample (if e(sample)) differs in N.")

* 多方法相关矩阵 (收敛效度: TF-IDF / LDA / Embedding 三法测同一构念应高相关)。
estpost correlate {{MAIN_DIFF_VAR}} strat_diff_n5_lda strat_diff_n5_emb, matrix
esttab using "$tables_dir/table1b_method_correlation.tex", replace ///
    not unstack compress booktabs ///
    title("Multi-Method Correlation (TF-IDF vs LDA vs Embedding)")

display "[OK] Table 1 → $tables_dir/table1_descriptives.tex + table1b_method_correlation.tex"
